<title>USA: Some U.S. corn gluten pellets down on soft demand.</title>
<headline>Some U.S. corn gluten pellets down on soft demand.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some U.S. corn gluten feed</p>
<p>pellets were lower Thursday, under pressure from a lack of</p>
<p>European buying interest, dealers said. Gluten meal prices were</p>
<p>steady on tight supplies.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  102.00    102.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   95.00     98.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
